  affiliation: Independent Researcher, Brussels, Belgium
abstract: Temporal AI Presence is sustained bounded AI participation across time. This standalone profile defines the temporal-presence category, preserves the boundary between TAP and c-class systems, specifies ten mandatory TAP tests, and publishes a conservative public-safe evidence projection. TAP-T03 remains partial at the deployment boundary. The work claims neither TAP-C nor a full M4 pass. The Zenodo version DOI is 10.5281/zenodo.22070960; the Concept DOI is pending first publication.
